  "title": "Jerk Pork Chops",
  "description": "Deliciously tender pork chops are marinated for 12 hours or longer in a mixture of lemon juice, oil, and spices, then grilled to perfection!",
  "authors": [
    "Marvin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-05-30T10:42:22-04:00",
